<!-- DOCUMENT HEADER -->
<div class="proposal-header">
  <div class="company-tagline">PROJECT PROPOSITION &amp; FUNCTIONAL SPECIFICATION</div>
  <h1>FreshMart: Digital Khata, Smart Voice POS &amp; Merchant Platform</h1>
  <div class="subtitle">A Zero-Hardware, Direct-UPI Operating Platform for Village Kirana Stores to Neighborhood Supermarkets</div>
  
  <table class="meta-grid">
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Document Title:</strong> First-Level Project &amp; Technical Proposal</td>
      <td><strong>Target Audience:</strong> Executive Management &amp; Review Board</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Document Version:</strong> 1.0 (Proposal Phase)</td>
      <td><strong>Project Lead / Prepared By:</strong> Technical Architecture Team</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Application Domain:</strong> Multi-Tenant Retail Fintech &amp; Ledger</td>
      <td><strong>Target Platforms:</strong> Web Portal, Android &amp; iOS Mobile App</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<!-- SECTION 1: EXECUTIVE OVERVIEW -->
<h2>1. Executive Overview &amp; Business Value</h2>
<p>
  <strong>FreshMart</strong> is a lightweight, mobile-first, multi-tenant digital operating system engineered specifically for local neighborhood merchants, grocery stores, provision shops, bakeries, and retail supermarkets.
</p>
<p>
  Traditional retail ERP systems are cumbersome, demand continuous barcode cataloging, and require expensive specialized hardware. Meanwhile, standard digital ledger apps are limited to passive bookkeeping and enforce heavy typing. <strong>FreshMart solves these bottlenecks</strong> with a zero-hardware architecture powered by <strong>Voice-Activated Quick Sales</strong>, <strong>Daily Cash Drawer (Galla) Balancing</strong>, <strong>Free In-App Voice Soundbox</strong>, and <strong>Multi-Tenant Direct-to-Bank 0% UPI Settlements</strong>.
</p>

<div class="callout-box">
  <strong>Strategic Highlights:</strong>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Zero Hardware Investment:</strong> Eliminates physical soundbox rental costs (saving ₹1,200–₹1,800 per year per store) and POS hardware costs.</li>
    <li><strong>Direct-to-Bank 0% Settlement:</strong> Bypasses 2% payment gateway cuts by dynamically routing customer payments straight to the individual shopkeeper's UPI VPA.</li>
    <li><strong>Frictionless Voice Entry:</strong> Shopkeepers talk naturally into their phone to record sales and debts in under 2 seconds.</li>
    <li><strong>Fast Daily Reconciliation:</strong> 30-second day-end cash drawer balancing that instantly catches cash leaks and discrepancies.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<!-- SECTION 2: PROBLEM STATEMENT & MARKET OPPORTUNITY -->
<h2>2. Problem Statement &amp; Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>
  Local retail commerce across rural, semi-urban, and neighborhood centers operates in fast-paced counter environments where shopkeepers face distinct operational pain points:
</p>

<table class="data-table">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 25%;">Market Challenge</th>
      <th style="width: 35%;">Traditional Practice / Competitors</th>
      <th style="width: 40%;">FreshMart Proposed Solution</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>High Typing Friction</strong></td>
      <td>Shopkeepers must search catalogs and type item details during peak counter rushes, leading to skipped entries.</td>
      <td><strong>Voice-Activated POS:</strong> Speech-to-intent engine records sales (<em>"56 note on sale"</em>) and purchases (<em>"Ramesh 2kg sugar 80"</em>) in 1 second.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Soundbox Rental Overhead</strong></td>
      <td>Payment vendors charge ₹100–₹150 monthly rent for physical audio soundbox speaker boxes.</td>
      <td><strong>Built-in Mobile Voice Soundbox:</strong> Real-time in-app audio chime and voice announcements directly through the shopkeeper's phone speaker for ₹0.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Intermediary Gateway Fees</strong></td>
      <td>Payment gateways deduct 2% transaction commission and hold funds in escrow accounts for 24–48 hours.</td>
      <td><strong>Direct Bank NPCI UPI Routing:</strong> Dynamic QR and UPI links deposit 100% of the funds instantly into the shopkeeper's personal/business bank account.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Cash Drawer (Galla) Leaks</strong></td>
      <td>Loose change, counter cash sales, and small petty expenses (tea, supplier chits) are tracked on loose paper chits, causing missing cash at closing.</td>
      <td><strong>Daily Galla Reconciliation:</strong> Real-time balancing formula with instant 30-second day-end physical count verification (<code>Balanced</code>, <code>Short</code>, <code>Excess</code>).</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Morning Delivery Routine</strong></td>
      <td>Dozens of recurring customers take daily milk packets or water cans; shopkeepers mark tally strokes on wall calendars or diaries.</td>
      <td><strong>Morning Regulars "Parcha" Checklist:</strong> 1-tap batch recording that updates 20+ customer balances in 5 seconds.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Bad Debts &amp; Defaulters</strong></td>
      <td>Merchants extend credit blindly without visibility into repayment speed or overall exposure.</td>
      <td><strong>Smart Credit Risk Badges:</strong> Dynamic scoring (🟢 Good, 🟡 Attention, 🔴 High Risk) that warns merchants before approving excessive credit.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<!-- SECTION 3: DETAILED SCOPE OF WORK (SOW) -->
<h2>3. Detailed Scope of Work (SOW)</h2>

<h3>3.1. In-Scope Functional Modules</h3>
<ol>
  <li>
    <strong>Multi-Tenant Shop Architecture &amp; Dynamic UPI Configuration:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Independent store profile management (Shop Name, UPI ID/VPA, Phone, Address, Category).</li>
      <li>Automatic tenant data isolation ensuring Shop A and Shop B customer accounts, debts, and cash flow never cross-mix.</li>
      <li>Dynamic UPI VPA injection into all customer payment portals, invoices, and QR codes.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Voice-to-Sale &amp; Natural Language POS Assistant:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Real-time speech recognition for quick sales, customer credit purchases, and drawer expenses.</li>
      <li>Smart entity extraction for amounts, product names, weights, and customer names across regional formats.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Daily Galla (Cash Register &amp; Reconciliation) Engine:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Opening cash drawer balance logging.</li>
      <li>Live cash register tracking: <code>Opening Cash + Quick Cash Sales + Udhaar Cash Received - Drawer Expenses = Expected Cash</code>.</li>
      <li>Day-end closing audit with automated cash variance calculation.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Built-in Mobile Voice Soundbox:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>High-fidelity payment notification chime and loud text-to-speech confirmation (e.g., <em>"Received ₹500 from Ramesh via UPI!"</em>).</li>
      <li>Configurable audio settings and test payment simulation triggers.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Customer Credit Ledger (Udhaar Khata) &amp; Auto-Communication:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Customer account creation with name, email, phone, address, and credit limit.</li>
      <li><strong>Smart Notification Routing:</strong> Generates instant WhatsApp reminders. If no WhatsApp number is provided, automatically dispatches account credentials, digital passbook links, and payment statements via <strong>Email</strong>.</li>
      <li>1-tap payment reminder generator with pre-filled direct UPI settlement deep links.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Credit Risk &amp; Bad-Debt Prevention Engine:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Automated risk scoring based on overdue aging and credit utilization ratios.</li>
      <li>Visual badges on customer lists: <span class="badge badge-green">🟢 Good Standing</span>, <span class="badge badge-amber">🟡 Attention Due</span>, <span class="badge badge-red">🔴 High Risk</span>.</li>
      <li>Safety override modal requiring explicit shopkeeper confirmation when adding credit to high-risk accounts.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Morning Regulars / "Parcha" Subscription Tally:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Setup recurring daily items for regulars (Milk packets, 20L Water Cans, Daily Breads).</li>
      <li>Morning batch checklist with 1-tap "Record All Selected" feature to log daily deliveries in seconds.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>AI Paper Chit &amp; Receipt OCR Scanner:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Optical character recognition parser for handwritten bills, supplier invoices, and counter paper chits.</li>
      <li>Extracts itemized tables and auto-populates credit purchase forms with one tap.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Printable Counter QR Standee &amp; Customer Self-Service Portal:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Generates printable, high-resolution shop counter standee posters with shop branding and direct UPI QR.</li>
      <li>Customer self-service passbook portal where customers log in to view bills, receipts, and click <strong>"Pay via UPI"</strong> to open their banking app with the exact shop UPI pre-filled.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ol>

<h3>3.2. Explicitly Out-of-Scope (Design Boundaries)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Complex Warehouse Inventory Batching:</strong> Excluded because target grocery and kirana merchants do not have time to maintain barcode SKUs and itemized inventory counts.</li>
  <li><strong>Third-Party Delivery Logistics / Driver Fleets:</strong> Excluded because neighborhood stores operate exclusively on counter walk-in trade and local pickup.</li>
</ul>

<!-- SECTION 4: USER ROLES & ACCESS CONTROL MATRIX (RBAC) -->
<h2>4. User Roles &amp; Access Control Matrix (RBAC)</h2>

<table class="data-table">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 20%;">Feature / Action</th>
      <th style="width: 25%;">System Super Admin</th>
      <th style="width: 30%;">Shop Owner (Merchant)</th>
      <th style="width: 25%;">Customer (End User)</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Shop Profile &amp; UPI Setup</strong></td>
      <td>Manage all registered stores</td>
      <td>Edit own Shop Name, UPI ID, Phone, Address</td>
      <td>View linked shop details only</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Customer Ledger &amp; Credit</strong></td>
      <td>Global telemetry view</td>
      <td>Full Add, Edit, Delete, Credit entry rights</td>
      <td>Read-only self passbook</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Daily Galla (Cash Register)</strong></td>
      <td>Audit logs only</td>
      <td>Full cash drawer opening &amp; closing control</td>
      <td>No Access</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Voice POS Assistant</strong></td>
      <td>System configuration</td>
      <td>Full Voice Recording (Sales/Purchases)</td>
      <td>No Access</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Morning Regulars Tally</strong></td>
      <td>System configuration</td>
      <td>Configure items &amp; run batch logs</td>
      <td>View own recurring charges</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Direct UPI Payments</strong></td>
      <td>Monitor payment rails</td>
      <td>Receive funds directly to bank UPI ID</td>
      <td>Execute 1-tap UPI payments</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>WhatsApp / Email Reminders</strong></td>
      <td>SMTP / API Settings</td>
      <td>Trigger 1-tap reminders &amp; statements</td>
      <td>Receive digital receipts &amp; links</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<!-- SECTION 5: TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE & STACK -->
<h2>5. Technical Architecture &amp; Platform Stack</h2>
<p>
  FreshMart is architected as a modern, decoupled, multi-tenant SaaS application designed for high availability, zero latency on counter actions, and cross-platform flexibility:
</p>

<div class="callout-box-blue">
  <strong>Core Technology Stack:</strong>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Mobile &amp; Web Frontend:</strong> React Native / Expo (SDK 57) with NativeWind (TailwindCSS) for a unified codebase deploying seamlessly across Android, iOS, and Web browsers.</li>
    <li><strong>Backend API Layer:</strong> Node.js and Express 5.x RESTful micro-architecture with clean controller-service separation.</li>
    <li><strong>Database &amp; Data Isolation:</strong> MongoDB with Mongoose ODM implementing strict tenant-scoped queries (<code>{ shopId: req.shopId }</code>) to prevent data leakage.</li>
    <li><strong>Audio &amp; Voice Synthesis:</strong> Web Speech API / Native SpeechSynthesizer for instant voice-to-text parsing and zero-hardware audio announcements.</li>
    <li><strong>Notification Infrastructure:</strong> Multi-channel dispatching with automated SMTP email fallbacks and dynamic WhatsApp URI intent schemes.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

