    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Phase 3</strong></td>
      <td>Smart Automation &amp; Regulars</td>
      <td>Morning Regulars ("Parcha") tally, AI Bill OCR Parser, Credit Risk Badges, and Email/WhatsApp notification fallback.</td>
