    <tr>
      <td><strong>Phase 4</strong></td>
      <td>Pilot Store Rollout &amp; Scaling</td>
      <td>Onboarding 25+ local pilot stores, merchant feedback loop, counter QR standee distribution, and performance optimization.</td>
