</table>

<!-- SECTION 7: BUSINESS IMPACT, COST & ROI ANALYSIS -->
<h2>7. Business Impact &amp; Return on Investment (ROI)</h2>

<table class="data-table">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 30%;">Operational Area</th>
      <th style="width: 35%;">Traditional Operating Cost</th>
      <th style="width: 35%;">FreshMart Cost &amp; Impact</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Voice Payment Audio Soundbox</strong></td>
      <td>₹100 to ₹150 / month per merchant (₹1,200–₹1,800/year hardware rental).</td>
      <td><strong>₹0 / Free:</strong> Built-in mobile speech engine on existing smartphone.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Digital Payment Gateway Fee</strong></td>
      <td>2.00% + GST deducted on every customer digital transaction.</td>
      <td><strong>0.00% Fee:</strong> Direct NPCI peer-to-merchant UPI rails into shopkeeper's bank account.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Counter Reconciliation Time</strong></td>
      <td>30–45 minutes daily manual ledger tallying and paper slip sorting.</td>
      <td><strong>&lt; 1 Minute:</strong> Automated real-time cash formula and 30-second day-end audit.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Overdue Credit (Udhaar) Recovery</strong></td>
      <td>Slow recovery; merchants forget debts or feel awkward chasing customers manually.</td>
      <td><strong>+35% Faster Collection:</strong> Automatic polite WhatsApp &amp; Email reminders with 1-tap payment buttons.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

